# --- iOS Specific Rules ---
**/dgph
*.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
*.moved-aside
*.pbxuser
*.perspectivev3
**/*sync/
.sconsign.dblite
.tags*
**/.vagrant/
**/DerivedData/
Icon?
**/Pods/
**/.symlinks/
ios/profile
ios/xcuserdata
**/.generated/
ios/Flutter/App.framework
ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
